OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F347A1786124905
OL,3,COfficer found not guilty of assault
OL,4,Cafter hitting autistic man with baton
OL,6,FA police officer has been found not
OL,7,Fguilty of assault occasioning actual
OL,8,Fbodily harm after an autistic man was
OL,9,Fstruck on the head with a baton,
OL,10,Fcausing him to bleed.
OL,12,FShaun Elliott, 56, who was a serving
OL,13,FDerbyshire Police constable, said he
OL,14,Fhad a "lawful purpose" to hit Kian
OL,15,FGreen, at Buxton Police Station on
OL,16,FDecember 30th, 2022.
OL,18,FElliott said he thought was going to
OL,19,Fbite his colleague and was trying to
OL,20,F"neutralise the threat" from Mr Green.
OL,26,@vD@GOUvD@VO]|D@AOU|D@WO]
