FL,348,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34707
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F347A1786124905
OL,3,COfficer found not guilty of assault
OL,4,Cafter hitting autistic man with baton
OL,6,FThe former constable, who worked for
OL,7,Fthe police for another three-and-a-
OL,8,Fhalf years after the incident in non-
OL,9,Fpublic facing duties, denied assault.
OL,10,FHe has since retired, the court heard.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G7/7
